% After a size change (\small, a footnote, a section title) the minimum is
% applied again, and the package's glue is put back if the size change
% replaced it (ctex does).  \size@update is \relax unless the size changed;
% LaTeX would run it only after this hook.  minipage, \parbox and p columns
% reset \baselineskip without a font change, so the minimum is also checked
% at the end of each paragraph.
